\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {I}{\ignorespaces Frozen benchmark suite, deployed configuration (octo\_seg\_thin768\_lraspp.pt). All splits are by SOURCE VIDEO; the segmentation test videos are excluded from every training source. Mask IoU comes from the same model and test set as the presence row, but that row's 19 negatives come from only two recordings; it is retained for continuity and is superseded by the multi-recording human-verified negative sets reported in the text. Tip-F1 scores arm recovery against the human mask's protrusions, so both missed and spurious arms are penalised; arm count is descriptive only.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:benchmarks}{{I}{4}{}{table.1}{}}
